{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05只有18秒，却堆了大量同时出现的感受词，部分表达还互相重复，X在这一段更利落、更容易扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最明显的优势是话里的关键心理动作被突出，且拆分成了更容易捕捉的节点：想靠近、怕给负担、收住、被看见、害怕失去，最后不再隐藏，前后变化比较容易跟上。它也更能把音乐中的细微变化落实为具体感受，尤其是情绪转折、声音走向和身体反应，不只是给出笼统的悲喜判断。X的完整句子其实更流畅，局部也更省力，但有些心理变化和音乐细节被压缩在长句或短词堆里，整体获得的信息层次不如Y丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8db5bfaa-a86c-4e0d-9eb1-9a9243d5196e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T210259869658Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:04:31.224774+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef6a8d3d63557ff7887fc26456be9b87b0ee950dbfbfa8d39eded5220133f384", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web